{"seq":3,"slug":"promotion-observability","title":"促销效果归因与预算监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/promotion-pricing-engine/performance-safety/promotion-observability","wordCount":2460,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"促销效果归因与预算监控\">促销效果归因与预算监控</h1><p>一场大促花了 200 万预算，GMV 涨了 800 万——这看起来是笔好生意，直到财务问一句&quot;如果没有这 200 万，这 800 万会不会照常发生&quot;。促销效果归因要回答的就是这个问题：<strong>增量到底有多少</strong>。它既是营销部门最关心的数字，也是技术系统必须交付的证据。同时，预算监控要确保那 200 万花在了计划的地方，而不是在某个凌晨被悄悄花光。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先把&quot;效果&quot;这个词拆成三个层次，它们的计算难度与可信度依次递增：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>可信度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>参与度</strong></td>\n<td>多少人用了这个活动</td>\n<td>直接计数</td>\n<td>高（客观）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>成本</strong></td>\n<td>花了多少钱</td>\n<td>账本求和</td>\n<td>高（客观）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>增量</strong></td>\n<td>多带来了多少生意</td>\n<td>对照组 / 因果推断</td>\n<td>低（有假设）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前两层是数据统计，做对了就是对的；第三层是因果推断，做对了也只是&quot;在某个假设下成立&quot;。很多团队的报表把三层混在一个数字里（&quot;本次活动贡献 GMV 800 万&quot;），结果是数字没人信、也没法用来决策。成熟的做法是<strong>分开呈现</strong>：参与度和成本照实报，增量必须附带方法与置信区间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单 + 券 + 活动快照] --&gt; B[归因: 这笔减免记在哪个活动账上]&#10;  B --&gt; C[参与度指标: 用券人数/核销率]&#10;  B --&gt; D[成本指标: 预算消耗/单位成本]&#10;  A --&gt; E[对照组构建]&#10;  E --&gt; F[增量指标: lift 与置信区间]&#10;  C --&gt; G[效果报表]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  D --&gt; H{预算监控}&#10;  H --&gt;|消耗超阈值| I[告警/自动降级]&#10;  H --&gt;|消耗异常快| J[风控联动]\">graph TD\n  A[订单 + 券 + 活动快照] --&gt; B[归因: 这笔减免记在哪个活动账上]\n  B --&gt; C[参与度指标: 用券人数/核销率]\n  B --&gt; D[成本指标: 预算消耗/单位成本]\n  A --&gt; E[对照组构建]\n  E --&gt; F[增量指标: lift 与置信区间]\n  C --&gt; G[效果报表]\n  D --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  D --&gt; H{预算监控}\n  H --&gt;|消耗超阈值| I[告警/自动降级]\n  H --&gt;|消耗异常快| J[风控联动]</pre><h2 id=\"归因-一笔减免算谁的\">归因：一笔减免算谁的</h2><p>一笔订单可能叠加了活动、券、支付优惠三种减免，报表要按活动拆分时，必须有一个确定的归因规则。归因的基础是<a href=\"../pricing-pipeline/pricing-stages\">商品价→活动→券→实付的阶段</a>里产生的 <code>deductions</code> 记录——这也是为什么每一笔减免都要带 <code>source</code>（哪个促销、哪张券）。</p>\n<p>常见归因规则与它们的适用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>按实际减免额</strong></td>\n<td>每笔减免记到它的 <code>source</code></td>\n<td>精确、可对账</td>\n<td>抄底效果差（券总是最后生效）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最后触点</strong></td>\n<td>全部记给最后一笔减免</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>高估券、低估满减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>首个触点</strong></td>\n<td>全部记给第一笔</td>\n<td>强调活动</td>\n<td>与用户感知不符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>均摊</strong></td>\n<td>按笔数平分</td>\n<td>公平</td>\n<td>都不准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>主流是<strong>按实际减免额</strong>：它唯一能与账本对账（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mtext>归因</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>账本总额</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\text{归因} = \\text{账本总额}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">归因</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">账本总额</span></span></span></span></span></span>），而线性归因类规则总会产生偏差且无法验证。具体做法是直接从订单快照的 <code>breakdown.lines[].lineDeductions</code> 里按 <code>source</code> 聚合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"INSERT INTO promotion_attribution&#10;     (promotion_id, stat_date, orders, users, deduction, coupon_used, gift_cost)&#10;SELECT d.source,&#10;       DATE(o.paid_at),&#10;       COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id),&#10;       COUNT(DISTINCT o.user_id),&#10;       SUM(d.amount),&#10;       SUM(d.kind = &#39;COUPON&#39;),&#10;       SUM(d.kind = &#39;GIFT&#39;)&#10;  FROM order_price_snapshot o,&#10;       JSON_TABLE(o.breakdown, &#39;$.lines[*].lineDeductions[*]&#39;&#10;                  COLUMNS (source VARCHAR(64) PATH &#39;$.source&#39;,&#10;                           amount BIGINT PATH &#39;$.amount&#39;,&#10;                           kind   VARCHAR(16) PATH &#39;$.kind&#39;)) d&#10; WHERE o.paid_at &gt;= :from AND o.paid_at &lt; :to&#10; GROUP BY d.source, DATE(o.paid_at);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> promotion_attribution</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">     (promotion_id, stat_date, orders, users, deduction, coupon_used, gift_cost)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'COUPON'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'GIFT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_price_snapshot o,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       JSON_TABLE(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">breakdown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$.lines[*].lineDeductions[*]'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                  COLUMNS (source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PATH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '$.source'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                           amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PATH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '$.amount'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                           kind   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PATH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '$.kind'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">to</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paid_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条 SQL 的关键在于<strong>数据源是订单价格快照而非当前的券表</strong>——券表会被后续的退款改写状态，而快照是下单那一刻的真相。用快照算历史报表，结果不会因为今天有人退款而改变。这与<a href=\"../pricing-pipeline/idempotent-pricing\">算价幂等与下单价一致</a>里&quot;存完整快照&quot;的理由完全一致。（<code>JSON_TABLE</code> 用于把 JSON 快照展开成关系行；它是 MySQL 8.0.4 引入的表函数，可接受 JSON 数据并返回带指定列的&quot;关系表&quot;，来源：MySQL 8.0 官方手册 What Is New in MySQL 8.0，<a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/mysql-nutshell.html\">https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/mysql-nutshell.html</a> ）</p>\n<p>归因要处理一个必须显式决策的问题：<strong>退款订单怎么算</strong>。三种口径，报表要标注用的是哪种：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>快照口径</td>\n<td>按支付时刻计入，退款不回溯</td>\n<td>活动即时效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>净额口径</td>\n<td>退款时扣减对应归因</td>\n<td>财务结算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟口径</td>\n<td>支付后 N 天无退款才计入</td>\n<td>保守的 ROI</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"增量-对照组是唯一诚实的办法\">增量：对照组是唯一诚实的办法</h2><p>要回答&quot;没有这 200 万会怎样&quot;，唯一可靠的办法是<strong>真的有一部分人没有这 200 万</strong>。这就是对照组（holdout）的设计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AB 实验</td>\n<td>随机分流入组/对照组</td>\n<td>可随机化的活动</td>\n<td>大促全场券无法随机化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理对照</td>\n<td>部分城市不发券</td>\n<td>地域性活动</td>\n<td>城市间不可比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间对照</td>\n<td>用活动前后趋势外推</td>\n<td>强季节场景</td>\n<td>季节与活动混淆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>合成对照</strong></td>\n<td>用历史相似期构造反事实</td>\n<td>无法实验时</td>\n<td>假设强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对于大促全场券（不可能真的拦下一半人不发券），实务上用<strong>倾向得分匹配 + 时间趋势外推</strong>：从历史订单中找出与本期结构相似的时段，用其增长趋势作为反事实基线。这种&quot;用一个由未受影响单元加权合成出的对照来近似处理组反事实轨迹&quot;的思路就是<strong>合成对照法</strong>（synthetic control）：对照组由若干未受干预单元加权平均合成，以复现处理单元在无干预情形下本会走出的轨迹（来源：Synthetic control method, Wikipedia，<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Synthetic_control_method\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Synthetic_control_method</a> ）。这个方法的输出必须带置信区间，且要说明它依赖&quot;结构未变&quot;这个假设。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>lift</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mtext>实际</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mtext>反事实</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mtext>反事实</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{lift} = \\frac{Y_{\\text{实际}} - Y_{\\text{反事实}}}{Y_{\\text{反事实}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lift</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">反事实</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">实际</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">反事实</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一个务实的纪律：<strong>报表里的增量数字必须能与它的方法一起展示</strong>。如果营销部门要一个&quot;本次大促增量 GMV&quot;的单数字，正确回应是给出&quot;在 X 方法、Y 假设下，增量 Z，置信区间 [a, b]&quot;，而不是一个看起来精确的整数。这一点与[促销效果归因与预算监控]的工程价值是一致的——数据的可信度取决于它的可复现性。</p>\n<p>单位经济指标比总量更有决策价值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>解读</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单位增量成本</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>总预算</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>增量订单数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{总预算} / \\text{增量订单数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总预算</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">增量订单数</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>越低越好，横向可比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ROI</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>增量 GMV</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>总预算</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{增量 GMV} / \\text{总预算}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">增量</span><span class=\"mord\"> GMV</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总预算</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>通常用毛利而非 GMV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>券核销率</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>核销数</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>发放数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{核销数} / \\text{发放数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">核销数</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">发放数</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>低说明发给了非目标人群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>券杠杆</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>核销带来的 GMV</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>券面额</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{核销带来的 GMV} / \\text{券面额}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">核销带来的</span><span class=\"mord\"> GMV</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">券面额</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高说明券撬动效果好</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>券杠杆</code>是很有用的一个数：假设 50 元券带来 350 元实付，杠杆是 7。如果某活动杠杆只有 1.2，说明用户本来就要买，券只是白送了钱。这个数比 ROI 更细，也更容易向业务解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预算监控-从-事后对账-到-实时刹车\">预算监控：从&quot;事后对账&quot;到&quot;实时刹车&quot;</h2><p>预算监控的目标不是&quot;事后发现超发了 3 万&quot;，而是&quot;在超发 3000 元时就刹住&quot;。这需要三级防线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>触发</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 实时速率</td>\n<td>消耗速率 &gt; 历史的 3σ</td>\n<td>告警（人工看）</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 阈值预警</td>\n<td>消耗 &gt; 总额的 80%</td>\n<td>告警 + 提示运营</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 自动刹车</td>\n<td>消耗 &gt; 总额的 100% 或异常速率持续</td>\n<td>自动下架 / 降级</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>L1 的速率监控是核心，因为大多数事故的信号是&quot;消耗速度不对&quot;而非&quot;消耗量不对&quot;。用滑动窗口比较当前速率与历史同期：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mtext>hist</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>hist</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score} = \\frac{r_{\\text{now}} - \\mu_{\\text{hist}}}{\\sigma_{\\text{hist}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hist</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hist</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>score &gt; 3</code> 即告警。这个简单的 z-score 在实战中非常有效，因为它对&quot;凌晨 3 点预算被刷光&quot;这种典型事故极其敏感——那个时段的正常速率接近零，任何消耗都会是巨大偏离。z-score 的定义就是&quot;原始值偏离均值多少个标准差&quot;，因此它天然是一个跟波动幅度同尺度、可跨活动比较的偏离度（来源：Standard score, Wikipedia，<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Standard_score\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Standard_score</a> ）。</p>\n<p>L3 的自动刹车需要谨慎，因为它会误伤正常的大促峰值。设计原则是<strong>刹车要有明确的恢复条件与责任人</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function budgetGuard(promotionId: string): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  const b = await budget.get(promotionId);&#10;  const rate = await metrics.consumptionRate(promotionId, &#39;5m&#39;);&#10;  const z = zScore(rate, await metrics.histBaseline(promotionId));&#10;&#10;  if (b.used / b.total &gt;= 1.0) {&#10;    await promotion.pause(promotionId, &#39;BUDGET_EXHAUSTED&#39;);&#10;    await alert.page(&#39;BUDGET_EXHAUSTED&#39;, { promotionId, used: b.used, total: b.total });&#10;    return;&#10;  }&#10;  if (z &gt; 5 &amp;&amp; b.used / b.total &gt; 0.5) {&#10;    await promotion.throttle(promotionId, 0.1); // 降到 10% 速率，不直接停&#10;    await alert.warn(&#39;BUDGET_RATE_ANOMALY&#39;, { promotionId, z });&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> budgetGuard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">promotionId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> budget.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(promotionId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> metrics.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">consumptionRate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(promotionId, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'5m'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> z</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> zScore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rate, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> metrics.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">histBaseline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(promotionId));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (b.used </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> promotion.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pause</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(promotionId, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BUDGET_EXHAUSTED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BUDGET_EXHAUSTED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { promotionId, used: b.used, total: b.total });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.used </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> promotion.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">throttle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(promotionId, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 降到 10% 速率，不直接停</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">warn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BUDGET_RATE_ANOMALY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { promotionId, z });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>throttle</code> 而非 <code>pause</code>：降速保留了正常用户的使用可能，同时把异常消耗压下来，给人留出判断时间。这与<a href=\"promotion-abuse\">羊毛党识别与领券风控</a>里的&quot;中风险降级&quot;是同一个思路——<strong>优先改变速率，而不是直接切断</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"报表要能被追问\">报表要能被追问</h2><p>最后一条，也是最实际的：效果报表的价值取决于能不能回答追问。三类问题必须能查到答案，否则报表只是装饰：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>追问</th>\n<th>需要的数据</th>\n<th>数据在哪</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&quot;这 300 万减免里，哪个活动花的最多？&quot;</td>\n<td>按活动聚合的归因</td>\n<td><code>promotion_attribution</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;为什么这个活动核销率只有 15%？&quot;</td>\n<td>发放人群、领取未使用比例、人群画像</td>\n<td>券表 + 身份实体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;这个用户为什么能用这么多券？&quot;</td>\n<td>该实体的领券轨迹与风控判定记录</td>\n<td>券表 + 风控日志</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三个问题的答案依赖<a href=\"promotion-abuse\">羊毛党识别与领券风控</a>里保留的行为痕迹与身份关联图；第二个问题依赖<a href=\"../budget-coupon/coupon-lifecycle\">券生命周期、核销与退款回退</a>的状态数据。所以&quot;可被追问&quot;不是报表的功能，而是<strong>前面每一节都留下可追溯数据</strong>的结果——报表只是把这些数据聚合起来展示。这也是本 hub 贯穿始终的一条线索：每一笔钱从被定义、被算、被发到被花，全程都要有痕迹。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>&quot;效果&quot;分三层：<strong>参与度</strong>（客观计数）、<strong>成本</strong>（账本求和）、<strong>增量</strong>（因果推断）；三层必须分开呈现，增量必须附方法与置信区间。</li>\n<li>归因按<strong>实际减免额</strong>（来自订单价格快照的 <code>deductions</code>），而不是抄底类规则；数据源用快照而非当前券表，历史报表才不会因退款而变。</li>\n<li>退款订单的口径（快照/净额/延迟）必须显式选择并在报表上标注。</li>\n<li>增量靠<strong>对照组</strong>才能诚实测量；无法实验时用合成对照并标明假设。</li>\n<li>比总量更有决策价值的指标是<strong>单位增量成本、ROI、券核销率、券杠杆</strong>。</li>\n<li>预算监控三级防线：速率 z-score 告警（L1）→ 阈值预警（L2）→ 自动刹车（L3）；刹车优先<strong>降速而非切断</strong>，并留恢复条件与责任人。</li>\n<li>报表的价值在于<strong>能被追问</strong>，而可追问性来自前面每一节都留下可追溯的数据。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"促销效果归因与预算监控","id":"促销效果归因与预算监控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"归因：一笔减免算谁的","id":"归因-一笔减免算谁的"},{"level":2,"text":"增量：对照组是唯一诚实的办法","id":"增量-对照组是唯一诚实的办法"},{"level":2,"text":"预算监控：从\"事后对账\"到\"实时刹车\"","id":"预算监控-从-事后对账-到-实时刹车"},{"level":2,"text":"报表要能被追问","id":"报表要能被追问"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"羊毛党识别与领券风控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/promotion-pricing-engine/performance-safety/promotion-abuse"},"next":null}